### The AquaDE desktop for Debian and Ubuntu, as one package that brings
### the rest: build it with equivs (apt install equivs) --
###
###   equivs-build packaging/debian/aquade-desktop.equivs
###   sudo apt install ./aquade-desktop_*_all.deb
###
### -- and the programs listed come with it, as GNOME's or KDE's come with
### theirs. They are the classic GTK programs of Xfce and MATE, the same
### set scripts/install_debian.sh and install_ubuntu.sh install. AquaDE
### itself is installed from its source (those scripts, or meson install),
### so it is not one of them. scripts/install-desktop.sh does the same on
### Fedora, Arch and openSUSE.
###
### Depends holds what the desk is used with every day, and every program
### Shell Settings' System pad opens (where Ubuntu 24.04 has no nwg-look,
### GNOME's Tweaks, which sets the same); Recommends what not every Debian
### or Ubuntu has (Klee), the Japanese converter, and the office suite and
### the other extras.
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Package: aquade-desktop
Version: 0.2
Maintainer: AquaDE <aquade@users.noreply.invalid>
Architecture: all
Depends: xfce4-terminal, thunar, gvfs, udisks2, thunar-volman, tumbler, mousepad, ristretto,
 atril, engrampa, zip, unzip, parole, firefox-esr | firefox, mate-polkit, gnome-keyring,
 libpam-gnome-keyring, network-manager, network-manager-applet | network-manager-gnome,
 nm-connection-editor | network-manager-gnome, blueman, udiskie,
 gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, poweralertd, package-update-indicator,
 pipewire-pulse | pulseaudio,
 wireplumber, pavucontrol, system-config-printer, cups, gnome-disk-utility, wdisplays,
 qdirstat | baobab, colord, lxqt-admin, mugshot, seahorse, gnome-packagekit,
 backintime-qt | deja-dup, xfce4-taskmanager, hardinfo2 | cpu-x, mesa-utils,
 qt6-wayland, qtwayland5,
 xfce4-settings, qt6-gtk-platformtheme, qt5-gtk-platformtheme,
 xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk,
 fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-cjk, fonts-noto-color-emoji, fonts-urw-base35,
 xdg-user-dirs, xdg-utils, xwayland, wl-clipboard, grim, slurp, libnotify-bin,
 dbus-user-session, nwg-look | gnome-tweaks, adwaita-icon-theme-legacy | yaru-theme-icon, ibus
Recommends: fonts-klee, ibus-mozc,
 libreoffice-writer, libreoffice-calc, libreoffice-impress, libreoffice-gtk3,
 thunderbird, galculator, xfce4-taskmanager, simple-scan
Description: AquaDE desktop: the free programs that go with AquaDE
 AquaDE draws the desk -- windows as sheets of paper on a walnut desk, the
 drawer, the bookcase, the post box, the Control Panel. This brings the free
 programs that make it a whole desktop: the classic GTK programs of Xfce
 and MATE -- terminal, files, text editor, viewers and player, archives --
 which leave their frame to AquaDE and lie on the desk as sheets of paper,
 Firefox, and the usual parts of a Linux desktop: networks, Bluetooth,
 sound, printing, disks, displays, the authentication agent, the keyring,
 portals and typefaces, with Qt programs dressed as the GTK ones.
